    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684300/extras/20d4d57c74ee669b1b60159ff41e0cbb.avif?t=1754507333\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of the Worlds: New York is an alien-invasion survival horror game. Players need to survive in the quarantine zone of New York, hunt alien zergs in the underground mazes, obtain more advanced tools and weapons, and finally challenge the giant tripod mechas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684300/extras/322d8ab92deb16f10c4c02342832032c.avif?t=1754507333\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zergs have appeared since the tripod mechas suddenly appeared from nowhere. Compared to the huge but rare tripod mechas, a large number of Zerg are actually more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to adapt to life in the quarantine zone, people used the previous subways and sewers to build complex activity spaces underground. Although the tripod mechas can't enter, the large number of alien insects they send can go deep into it. As a result, the underground mazes have become the best alien insect hunting grounds. If you are strong enough or have friends to help you, you can kill everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In the night streets and the dark underground, survive in horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Complete game story, several explorable mazes, at least 20 hours of game time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rich survival gameplay, unlocked along with the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Single player survival is challenging, multiplayer cooperation is fun</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684300/extras/20d4d57c74ee669b1b60159ff41e0cbb.avif?t=1754507333\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of the Worlds: New York is an alien-invasion survival horror game. Players need to survive in the quarantine zone of New York, hunt alien zergs in the underground mazes, obtain more advanced tools and weapons, and finally challenge the giant tripod mechas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684300/extras/322d8ab92deb16f10c4c02342832032c.avif?t=1754507333\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zergs have appeared since the tripod mechas suddenly appeared from nowhere. Compared to the huge but rare tripod mechas, a large number of Zerg are actually more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to adapt to life in the quarantine zone, people used the previous subways and sewers to build complex activity spaces underground. Although the tripod mechas can't enter, the large number of alien insects they send can go deep into it. As a result, the underground mazes have become the best alien insect hunting grounds. If you are strong enough or have friends to help you, you can kill everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In the night streets and the dark underground, survive in horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Complete game story, several explorable mazes, at least 20 hours of game time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rich survival gameplay, unlocked along with the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Single player survival is challenging, multiplayer cooperation is fun</p>",
